   Avci, Aziz; Uzum, Nazan; Olgun, Kurtulus, Aydin Adnan Menderes Univ, Fac Sci, Dept Biol, TR-09010 Aydin, Turkiye.
   Ilgaz, Cetin; Kumlutas, Yusuf, Dokuz Eylul Univ, Fac Sci, Dept Biol, TR-35390 Izmir, Turkiye.
   Lymberakis, Petros, Univ Crete, Sch Sci \& Engn, Nat Hist Museum Crete, Knossos Av, Iraklion 71409, Greece.},
