   Vagaggini, Chiara and Poggialini, Federica and Dreassi, Elena and
   Frosini, Maria and Schiano Moriello, Aniello and De Petrocellis, Luciano
   and Morace, Andrea Maria and Belardo, Carmela and Perrone, Michela and
   Bonsale, Roozbe and Luongo, Livio and Maione, Sabatino and Talyzina,
